# Git Conventions

## Commit format (Conventional Commits)
```
<type>: <short description>

feat: add multi-stage Dockerfile for backend
fix: correct postgres connection string in compose
chore: add .dockerignore to nextjs service
docs: update README with AWS setup steps
```

Types: `feat`, `fix`, `chore`, `docs`, `refactor`, `test`

## Branch
Students work on `emri-mbiemri` (their own name branch).

## Never commit
- `.env` files or any file containing secrets
- `*.tfstate`, `*.tfvars`
- `*.pem`, AWS credentials
- `node_modules/`, `bin/`, `obj/`
